# playerversus_music_supers_5: part of the soundtrack of PLAYER VERSUS (the super themes, hammerhead to moth). The soundtrack is split
# over several packages so each one is small enough for the registry to take. The tracks are the
# .ogg files in music/ (credits in music/SOURCES.md).
#
# Flywheel doesn't tell a module where its files are, so PLAYER VERSUS finds this package's folder
# itself (music.fw looks where Pulley puts dependencies) and plays music/<name>.ogg from it.

# The folder inside this package that holds the tracks.
const string MUSIC_FOLDER = "music"
